---
/** Mark + wordmark logo used in the nav and footer. The mark is Colophon's octagonal C
 * (docs/brand/colophon-mark.svg in the Colophon repo) and follows the text colour. */
---

<span
  style="display: flex; align-items: center; height: 32px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--c-ink); white-space: nowrap; gap: 8px;"
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 292 310" width="19" height="20" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;">
    <path
      fill="currentColor"
      d="M87 0H232L292 60L232 120L194 82H130L87 125V185L130 228H194L232 190L292 250L232 310H87L0 223V87Z"
    ></path>
  </svg>
  Colophon
</span>
